OL,3,APolice examine video of anti-migrant
OL,4,Aactivist slashing dinghy with knife
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are looking into a video
OL,7,Fappearing to show anti-migrant activist
OL,8,FDaniel Thomas slashing at an inflatable
OL,9,Fboat with a knife in the English
OL,10,FChannel.
OL,12,FThe boat had been carrying about 50
OL,13,Fmigrants who had launched from a beach
OL,14,Fin Normandy. They were picked up by two
OL,15,FRNLI lifeboats once they had reached
OL,16,Fthe UK search and rescue area and were
OL,17,Ftaken to Dover for processing.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
