OL,3,ATigray forces seize main airport in
OL,4,Anorthern Ethiopia from police,
OL,5,Aresidents tell the BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FLocal forces in Ethiopia's northern
OL,8,Fregion of Tigray have seized control of
OL,9,Fthe airport in the regional capital,
OL,10,FMekelle, from federal police, local
OL,11,Fresidents have told the BBC.
OL,13,FNo flights are currently landing at the
OL,14,Fairport and Ethiopian Airlines said it
OL,15,Fhad suspended flights to Mekelle and
OL,16,Fthe cities of Shire and Axum because of
OL,17,Fwhat it called the "current situation"
OL,18,Fin Tigray.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
